+# DADAO target for gem5
+
+This directory holds the DADAO-v5 ISA implementation for the gem5
+`v25.1.0.1` baseline. The source of truth is the DADAO-v5 project's `spec/`
+and `contracts/` trees, especially `spec/Machine-01-测试机运行环境.md` for
+the bare-metal machine interface. The gem5 implementation is a separate
+functional execution model; QEMU results are diagnostic, not expected values.
+
+Build and test commands, patch provenance, and coverage are documented in
+`components/gem5/README.md` and `.tao/tasks/gem5/` in the DADAO-v5 project.
